  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Javea? (or L\u00e9rida N R. Ebro). Name known only from Avienus; otherwise unattested.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "An ancient settlement reported only by the 4th century CE Roman poet Avienus, who places it on the east coast of the Iberian peninsula. If it is not a fiction, it might be identified as either modern Javea or modern L\u00e9rida, north of the river Ebro.",
